@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
title FiscalWave — Idempotent issuance / Emisión idempotente (proposed)
skinparam shadowing false
actor Client
participant "Fiscal API" as API
database "Fiscal DB\n(Idempotency + DTE + Outbox)" as DB
queue "Event broker" as Q
participant "SII Connector" as SII
Client -> API : POST /issue + Idempotency-Key
API -> DB : Authenticate tenant; reserve scoped key + fingerprint
alt new / nueva
  DB --> API : reserved
  API -> DB : Transaction: allocate unique folio,\nsign document, save outbox + result
  DB --> API : committed document ID
  API --> Client : 202 Accepted + Location
else same key and same fingerprint / repetida
  DB --> API : stored result/pending
  API --> Client : same result or 202 + status URI
else same key, different fingerprint / contenido distinto
  DB --> API : conflict
  API --> Client : 409 Conflict
end
DB -> Q : outbox publisher (at least once)
Q -> SII : event ID, document ref
SII -> SII : inbox deduplication
note right of SII
External timeout != rejection.
Reconcile unknown status
before resubmission.
end note
@enduml
